Maintainer: Ang Yu <ang_yu@outlook.com>
Description: Implements a Riesz regression test for whether natural mediation
    effects differ from their randomized interventional analogues. The test
    estimates TE - TER and uses it to falsify the composite null that the natural
    indirect and direct effects equal their randomized interventional analogues,
    even when the natural effects are not identified. The package extends the
    'crumble' R package by Williams and Díaz (2024), retaining its
    Riesz-learning machinery for natural, organic, randomized interventional,
    and recanting-twin mediation estimands while adding the test developed in
    Yu, Ge, and Elwert (2026).
